# The agent harness writes here. .claude/worktrees holds a full checkout with
# its own target directory, and it reached 169 MB during one wave. .gsd holds
# a dispatch sentinel. Neither is source.
.claude/
.gsd/

# PAI registers a project by writing this file. It holds machine state, not
# a decision. No other repository of this author tracks it.
Notes/PAI.md

# The research agents write a web-fetch cache here. It is machine-local and
# it is not evidence. The research documents beside it are.
.planning/research/.cache/

# Build output. Cargo.lock is committed on purpose; see AGENTS.md.
/target
**/*.rs.bk
